Subject: [PATCH] Opening a file that is already open shows the version on disk

A mail program saves a newer attachment of the same name to the same path and opens it
again; PdfCraft focused the tab with the old version. Now the file is read when it is
opened again: a different version reloads the tab in place (or, with unsaved changes,
shows the Reload bar).
